('91', '18', 'user', 'Generate Monthly Report', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-12 03:53:07', '2026-08-12 03:53:07'),
('92', '18', 'assistant', '### Monthly Administrative Report: August 2026\n\n#### 1. Overview & Key Metrics\n* **Total Active Students:** 602\n* **Total Scholarships Awarded:** 0\n* **Total Offenses Recorded:** 2\n* **Pending Fine Applications:** 0\n* **Pending Vehicle Stickers:** 0\n\n#### 2. Disciplinary Offenses Summary\nA total of 2 disciplinary offenses were recorded for the month of August 2026:\n* **AMIRUL ASYRAF BIN AHMAD NASHARUDIN** (Matric No: `34DIT24F1029`)\n  * **Date:** 2026-08-11\n  * **Location:** Dewan Siku Keluang\n  * **Fine Amount:** RM50.00\n  * **Status:** Unpaid\n* **HAFIZUL IRFAN BIN AHMAD HILMI** (Matric No: `34DIT24F1011`)\n  * **Date:** 2026-08-11\n  * **Location:** Kamsis\n  * **Fine Amount:** RM500.00\n  * **Status:** Paid\n\n#### 3. Scholarship Status\n* No scholarship records or allocations were processed or available for the reporting month of August 2026.\n\n***\n*Report generated automatically by StudentEdge Admin AI Research Assistant.*', 'gemini', 'gemini-3.5-flash-lite', '2026-08-12 03:53:07', '2026-08-12 03:53:07'),
('93', '18', 'user', 'tell me about me', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-12 04:11:10', '2026-08-12 04:11:10'),
('94', '18', 'assistant', 'Well, according to the system records, you\'re Hafizul, and you\'re logged in as a system admin here at the polytechnic. Anything specific you\'d like to check or work on today?', 'gemini', 'gemini-3.5-flash-lite', '2026-08-12 04:11:10', '2026-08-12 04:11:10'),
('95', '18', 'user', 'i want to know about the system performance', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-12 04:11:28', '2026-08-12 04:11:28'),
('96', '18', 'assistant', '### System Performance & Status Report\n\n#### 1. Operational Overview\n* **Active User Role:** System Administrator (`Hafizul`)\n* **System Status:** Operational and responsive to authorized administrative queries.\n* **Data Context Mode:** SYSTEM-DATA MODE active (querying live JSON context for August 2026).\n\n#### 2. Current Processing Metrics (August 2026)\n* **Total Active Student Records Managed:** 602\n* **Disciplinary Records Logged:** 2\n* **Pending Administrative Backlogs:** 0 (0 pending fine applications, 0 pending vehicle stickers)\n* **Scholarship Processing Volume:** 0 records for the current reporting month.\n\n#### 3. System Integrity & Response\n* All queries are processed securely within authorized parameters. \n* No data discrepancies or pending queues detected in current operational metrics.', 'gemini', 'gemini-3.5-flash-lite', '2026-08-12 04:11:28', '2026-08-12 04:11:28'),
('97', '18', 'user', 'tell me about the feature inside this system', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-12 04:11:54', '2026-08-12 04:11:54'),
('98', '18', 'assistant', '### StudentEdge Admin AI System Features\n\nBased on the authorized operational context and administrative capabilities, the StudentEdge system provides the following core features and modules:\n\n#### 1. Student Population Management\n* **Active Records Tracking:** Maintains and monitors active student profiles (currently tracking 602 students in the active scope).\n* **Matriculation & Identity Lookup:** Associates academic identifiers (e.g., matriculation numbers like `34DIT24F1029` and `34DIT24F1011`) with specific administrative records.\n\n#### 2. Disciplinary & Offense Tracking\n* **Incident Logging:** Records campus disciplinary infractions, including specific dates, locations (e.g., *Dewan Siku Keluang*, *Kamsis*), and associated student details.\n* **Fine & Status Management:** Tracks financial penalties and payment compliance status (differentiating between `paid` and `unpaid` fines).\n\n#### 3. Administrative Backlog & Workflow Monitoring\n* **Pending Task Queues:** Real-time monitoring of operational backlogs, specifically tracking pending fine applications and vehicle sticker requests (currently at 0 pending items).\n* **Scholarship Allocation Support:** Capability to query and review scholarship distributions and records per reporting period.\n\n#### 4. Automated Reporting & Analytics\n* **Monthly Administrative Reporting:** Generates structured summaries consolidating metrics across student populations, offenses, and administrative workflows for specific months (such as August 2026).\n* **AI Research Assistant Integration:** Fact extraction, data comparison, and conversational querying restricted strictly to authorized system-data contexts without inventing records.', 'gemini', 'gemini-3.5-flash-lite', '2026-08-12 04:11:54', '2026-08-12 04:11:54'),
('99', '18', 'user', 'tell me all the total function inside this system', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-12 04:12:32', '2026-08-12 04:12:32'),
('100', '18', 'assistant', '### StudentEdge System Functions & Modules\n\nBased on the authorized administrative framework and operational scope, the StudentEdge system provides the following core functions:\n\n#### 1. Student Population Management\n* **Active Record Tracking:** Monitors and manages active student enrollment data (currently tracking 602 students).\n* **Identity & Matriculation Lookup:** Links academic profiles and matriculation numbers (e.g., `34DIT24F1029`, `34DIT24F1011`) to administrative, disciplinary, and financial records.\n\n#### 2. Disciplinary & Offense Management\n* **Incident Logging:** Captures campus infractions with precise details including offense dates, specific locations (e.g., *Dewan Siku Keluang*, *Kamsis*), and student identifiers.\n* **Fine & Status Tracking:** Manages financial penalties, tracking individual fine amounts and payment statuses (`paid` vs. `unpaid`).\n\n#### 3. Administrative Workflow & Queue Monitoring\n* **Backlog Oversight:** Real-time tracking of operational queues, specifically monitoring pending fine applications and vehicle sticker requests.\n* **Scholarship Data Review:** Queries and reviews scholarship distributions and allocations for specific reporting periods.\n\n#### 4. Automated Reporting & AI Administration\n* **Monthly Administrative Reporting:** Compiles structured summaries of key operational metrics across student populations, offenses, and administrative workflows for designated months (e.g., August 2026).\n* **AI-Assisted Research & Fact Extraction:** Conducts document analysis, data comparison, summarization, and reporting strictly based on authorized system-data contexts.', 'gemini', 'gemini-3.5-flash-lite', '2026-08-12 04:12:32', '2026-08-12 04:12:32'),
('101', '18', 'user', 'okay thats all', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-12 04:12:48', '2026-08-12 04:12:48'),
('102', '18', 'assistant', 'Glad I could help, Hafizul! Let me know if you need anything else later on. Have a great day!', 'gemini', 'gemini-3.5-flash-lite', '2026-08-12 04:12:48', '2026-08-12 04:12:48'),
('103', '19', 'user', 'Generate Monthly Report', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-12 18:40:05', '2026-08-12 18:40:05'),
('104', '19', 'assistant', '### Monthly Report – August 2026\n\n**Prepared By:** Norazlina Binti Abdullah (Student Affairs Head)  \n**Reporting Period:** August 2026  \n**Institution:** Malaysian Polytechnic (StudentEdge System)  \n\n---\n\n### 1. Executive Summary\nThis report summarizes key student affairs metrics for August 2026 based on authorized system data. The total active student population stands at **602**. During this period, a total of **2 offenses** were recorded, with no pending fine applications or vehicle sticker requests requiring immediate action.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Key Statistics\n* **Total Students Enrolled:** 602\n* **Total Scholarships Awarded:** 0\n* **Total Offenses Recorded (August 2026):** 2\n* **Pending Fine Applications:** 0\n* **Pending Vehicle Sticker Requests:** 0\n\n---\n\n### 3. Recent Offense Records\nA total of two disciplinary incidents were logged during August 2026:\n\n| Full Name | Matric No. | Offense Date | Location | Fine Amount (RM) | Status |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Amirul Asyraf Bin Ahmad Nasharudin | 34DIT24F1029 | 2026-08-11 | Dewan Siku Keluang | 50.00 | Unpaid |\n| Hafizul Irfan Bin Ahmad Hilmi | 34DIT24F1011 | 2026-08-11 | Kamsis | 500.00 | Paid |\n\n---\n\n### 4. Administrative Notes & Action Items\n* **Fines & Disciplinary Follow-up:** Follow-up action is required for the unpaid fine (RM50.00) associated with student Amirul Asyraf Bin Ahmad Nasharudin (34DIT24F1029).\n* **Scholarships:** No scholarship data or active disbursements were registered for this reporting cycle.', 'gemini', 'gemini-3.5-flash-lite', '2026-08-12 18:40:05', '2026-08-12 18:40:05'),
('105', '20', 'user', 'hi', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-13 02:02:09', '2026-08-13 02:02:09'),
