('107', '21', 'user', 'Summarize Scholarship Status', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-13 02:07:27', '2026-08-13 02:07:27'),
('108', '21', 'assistant', '### Scholarship Status Summary\n\n**Report Period:** August 2026 (`2026-08`)  \n**Total Monitored Students:** 602  \n**Total Active/Confirmed Scholarships:** 4  \n\n#### Overview\nFor the current reporting month, there are **4 confirmed scholarship records** logged in the system. All current recipients are under the same provider category.\n\n#### Confirmed Scholarship Records\n* **NUUR AINA FARISHA BINTI MD RIDUAN** (Matric: `34DDT23F1119`)  \n  * Provider: SCHOLARSHIP B40 TVET  \n  * Status: Confirmed  \n  * Amount: *Not specified in system data*\n\n* **NUR FAIZAH BINTI ABDUL FATAH** (Matric: `34DDT23F1137`)  \n  * Provider: SCHOLARSHIP B40 TVET  \n  * Status: Confirmed  \n  * Amount: *Not specified in system data*\n\n* **DEENA A/L LOGANATHAN** (Matric: `34DIT25F1019`)  \n  * Provider: SCHOLARSHIP B40 TVET  \n  * Status: Confirmed  \n  * Amount: *Not specified in system data*\n\n* **FARAH ATIKAH LIYANA BINTI MUHAMAD RAMLI** (Matric: `34DBF23F1003`)  \n  * Provider: SCHOLARSHIP B40 TVET  \n  * Status: Confirmed  \n  * Amount: *Not specified in system data*\n\n#### Additional Notes\n* No pending or alternate scholarship statuses were returned in the active system filter for this period. \n* Financial amounts for the listed scholarships are currently unavailable in the authorized dataset.', 'gemini', 'gemini-3.5-flash-lite', '2026-08-13 02:07:27', '2026-08-13 02:07:27');
